   "stem": {
      "text": "Let \\( g \\) be the function defined by \\( g(x) = \\cos\\left(x^{2}\\right) \\). The curve \\( C \\) is defined by the equation \\( xy + y^{2} = 6 \\), and the point \\( (1, 2) \\) lies on \\( C \\)."
   },
   "skills": [
      "BC-SKL-03030",
      "BC-SKL-03031",
